{"channelId":"UCVHSgXEGMmQS63V6wpRx-DA","row":["Steve Treloar's Equine Align",2,"Equine-Alignment care is a manual therapy that can restore correct biomechanical function and reduce or eliminate performance problems, acute or chronic pain, and health issues in horses.\n\nBy restoring the correct movement of the joints, particularly those of the spine, the animal becomes better able to maintain its own health and achieve its full potential within its field.\n\nEquine-Alignment care should be used alongside traditional veterinary care to enhance the wellbeing of the horse. \n\nSteve Treloar's Equine Align care may help to:\nProvide gentle musculoskeletal alignment for the enhancement of movement or performance, of your horse and Integrate its movement to enhance performance\n\nSteve Treloar's qualifications include:\n​\nBachelor of Applied Science (Chiropractor)\nCert BT—Certified Equine Bowen Therapist (ISBT)\nCertified Equine Rehabilitation and Training (ACAAT)","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVHSgXEGMmQS63V6wpRx-DA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVHSgXEGMmQS63V6wpRx-DA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:17:46.019Z","channelId":"UCVHSgXEGMmQS63V6wpRx-DA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"42e7e1551d645e81dfe71b223624aae7a1ca5b4369d18816cf83fb1dd94dee3b","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"d6396ee0c3c9898f743100f7ffa66f9155cdf84625ceacdbaa07b7e17ceb8aa1"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVHSgXEGMmQS63V6wpRx-DA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2,"raw":"2 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVHSgXEGMmQS63V6wpRx-DA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:17:46.019Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"chiropractors","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索